As long as its on the same plane of existence as you, you can take a Bonus Action to maintain the connection and extend the duration until the end of your next turn.","page":1,"x":226,"y":463},{"name":"Actions2","value":"While perceiving through the other creature’s senses, you benefit from any special senses possessed by that creature, and you can cast spells as if you were in your space or the other creature’s space if you’re within 60 ft. of each other. Healing Light: Expend Healing • 21 / Long Rest You can heal yourself or one creature you can see within 60 ft. by expending dice from the pool. You can expend up to 3 at once. You restore HP equal to the dice expended. You regain all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest. Pact of the Chain: Quick Attack You can command the familiar to take the Attack action.","page":1,"x":405,"y":463},{"name":"Wpn Name","value":"Dagger","page":1,"x":225,"y":631},{"name":"Wpn1 AtkBonus","value":"+9","page":1,"x":342,"y":631},{"name":"Wpn1 Damage","value":"1d4+3 Piercing","page":1,"x":378,"y":631},{"name":"Wpn Notes 1","value":"Simple, Finesse, Light, Thrown, Nick, Range (20/60), Booming Blade: 3d8 Thunder, 4d8 Thunder","page":1,"x":444,"y":631},{"name":"Wpn Name 2","value":"Sickle","page":1,"x":225,"y":651},{"name":"Wpn2 AtkBonus ","value":"+5","page":1,"x":342,"y":651},{"name":"Wpn2 Damage ","value":"1d4-1 Slashing","page":1,"x":378,"y":651},{"name":"Wpn Notes 2","value":"Simple, Light, Nick, Booming Blade: 3d8 Thunder, 4d8 Thunder","page":1,"x":444,"y":652},{"name":"Wpn Name 3","value":"Eldritch Blast","page":1,"x":225,"y":672},{"name":"Wpn3 AtkBonus  ","value":"+9","page":1,"x":342,"y":672},{"name":"Wpn3 Damage ","value":"1d10+3 Force","page":1,"x":378,"y":672},{"name":"Wpn Notes 3","value":"Count: 4, V/S","page":1,"x":444,"y":672},{"name":"Wpn Name 4","value":"Unarmed Strike","page":1,"x":225,"y":693},{"name":"Wpn4 AtkBonus","value":"+5","page":1,"x":342,"y":693},{"name":"Wpn4 Damage","value":"0 Bludgeoning","page":1,"x":378,"y":693},{"name":"Inspiration","value":"Off","page":1,"x":230,"y":272},{"name":"CharacterName2","value":"Zlatko Galanodel","page":2,"x":47,"y":60},{"name":"CLASS  LEVEL2","value":"Warlock 20","page":2,"x":271,"y":49},{"name":"PLAYER NAME2","value":"Player","page":2,"x":470,"y":49},{"name":"RACE2","value":"Elf","page":2,"x":271,"y":75},{"name":"BACKGROUND2","value":"Noble","page":2,"x":383,"y":75},{"name":"EXPERIENCE POINTS2","value":"(Milestone)","page":2,"x":480,"y":75},{"name":"FeaturesTraits1","value":"=== WARLOCK FEATURES === * Core Warlock Traits • PHB-2024 153 * Eldritch Invocations • PHB-2024 153 You have unearthed Eldritch Invocations, pieces of forbidden knowledge that imbue you with an abiding magical ability or other lessons. If an invocation has a prerequisite, you must meet it to learn that invocation. | Agonizing Blast (Eldritch Blast) • br-2024 You can add your Cha. modifier bonus to the damage rolls of Eldritch Blast. | Armor of Shadows • br-2024 You can cast Mage Armor on yourself without expending a spell slot. | Gaze of Two Minds • br-2024 You can use a Bonus Action to touch a willing creature and perceive through its senses until the end of your next turn. As long as its on the same plane of existence as you, you can take a Bonus Action to maintain the connection and extend the duration until the end of your next turn. While perceiving through the other creature’s senses, you benefit from any special senses possessed by that creature, and you can cast spells as if you were in your space or the other creature’s space if you’re within 60 ft. of each other. | Gaze of Two Minds: Perceive Senses: 1 Bonus Action | Gift of the Depths • br-2024 You can breathe underwater and gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed. Once per Long Rest, you can also cast Water Breathing without expending a spell slot.","page":2,"x":36,"y":136},{"name":"FeaturesTraits2","value":"| Investment of the Chain Master • br-2024 When you cast Find Familiar, you infuse the summon familiar and grant it the following benefits: • The familiar gains either a Fly or Swim Speed (your choice) of 40 ft. • As a Bonus Action, you can command the familiar to take the Attack action. • Whenever the familiar deals Bludgeoning, Piercing, or Slashing damage, you can make it deal Necrotic or Radiant damage instead. • If the familiar forces a creature to make a saving throw, it uses your spell save DC. • When the familiar takes damage, you can take a Reaction to grant it Resistance against that damage. | Pact of the Chain: Quick Attack: 1 Bonus Action | Pact of the Chain: Resistance: 1 Reaction | One with Shadows • br-2024 While you’re in an area of Dim Light or Darkness, you can cast Invisibility on yourself without expending a spell slot. | Otherworldly Leap • br-2024 You can cast Jump without expending a spell slot. | Pact of the Chain • br-2024 You learn Find Familiar and can cast it as a Magic action without expending a spell slot. When you take the Attack action, you can forgo one of your own attacks to allow your familiar to make one attack with its Reaction. | Pact of the Chain: Attack: 1 Action | Repelling Blast • br-2024 Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that requires an attack roll. When you hit a Large or smaller","page":2,"x":219,"y":136},{"name":"FeaturesTraits3","value":"creature with that cantrip, you can push the creature up to 10 ft. straight away from you. | Witch Sight • br-2024 You have Truesight with a range of 30 ft. * Pact Magic • PHB-2024 153 * Magical Cunning • PHB-2024 154 Once per Long Rest, you can perform an esoteric rite for 1 minute, regaining up to 2 expended Pact Magic spell slots. | 1 / Long Rest • 1 Minute * Warlock Subclass • PHB-2024 154 | Celestial Patron * Celestial Spells • PHB-2024 160 When you reach a Warlock level specified in the Celestial Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared. * Healing Light • PHB-2024 160 You gain the ability to channel celestial energy to heal wounds and have a pool of 21d6 to fuel this healing. As a Bonus Action, you can heal yourself or one creature you can see within 60 ft. by expending dice from the pool. You can expend up to 3 at once. You restore HP equal to the dice expended. You regain all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest. | Healing Light: Expend Healing: 21 / Long Rest • 1 Bonus Action * Ability Score Improvement • PHB-2024 155 * Radiant Soul • PHB-2024 160 You have Resistance to Radiant damage. Once per","page":2,"x":400,"y":136},{"name":"CP","value":"0","page":2,"x":38,"y":524},{"name":"SP","value":"0","page":2,"x":38,"y":553},{"name":"EP","value":"0","page":2,"x":38,"y":582},{"name":"GP","value":"44","page":2,"x":38,"y":611},{"name":"PP","value":"0","page":2,"x":38,"y":639},{"name":"Weight Carried","value":"50 lb.","page":2,"x":37,"y":677},{"name":"Encumbered","value":"120 lb.","page":2,"x":37,"y":705},{"name":"PushDragLift","value":"240 lb.","page":2,"x":37,"y":734},{"name":"Eq Name0","value":"Leather","page":2,"x":112,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Qty0","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Weight0","value":"10 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Name1","value":"Dagger","page":2,"x":112,"y":540},{"name":"Eq Qty1","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":540},{"name":"Eq Weight1","value":"1 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":540},{"name":"Eq Name2","value":"Dagger","page":2,"x":112,"y":555},{"name":"Eq Qty2","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":555},{"name":"Eq Weight2","value":"1 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":555},{"name":"Eq Name3","value":"Sickle","page":2,"x":112,"y":570},{"name":"Eq Qty3","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":570},{"name":"Eq Weight3","value":"2 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":570},{"name":"Eq Name4","value":"Perfume","page":2,"x":112,"y":585},{"name":"Eq Qty4","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":585},{"name":"Eq Weight4","value":"--","page":2,"x":306,"y":585},{"name":"Eq Name5","value":"Backpack","page":2,"x":112,"y":599},{"name":"Eq Qty5","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":599},{"name":"Eq Weight5","value":"5 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":599},{"name":"Eq Name6","value":"Book","page":2,"x":112,"y":614},{"name":"Eq Qty6","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":614},{"name":"Eq Weight6","value":"5 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":614},{"name":"Eq Name7","value":"Dice","page":2,"x":112,"y":629},{"name":"Eq Qty7","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":629},{"name":"Eq Weight7","value":"--","page":2,"x":306,"y":629},{"name":"Eq Name8","value":"Orb","page":2,"x":112,"y":644},{"name":"Eq Qty8","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":644},{"name":"Eq Weight8","value":"3 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":644},{"name":"Eq Name9","value":"Fine Clothes","page":2,"x":112,"y":659},{"name":"Eq Qty9","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":659},{"name":"Eq Weight9","value":"6 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":659},{"name":"Eq Name10","value":"Oil","page":2,"x":112,"y":674},{"name":"Eq Qty10","value":"10","page":2,"x":272,"y":674},{"name":"Eq Weight10","value":"10 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":674},{"name":"Eq Name11","value":"Parchment","page":2,"x":112,"y":689},{"name":"Eq Qty11","value":"10","page":2,"x":272,"y":689},{"name":"Eq Weight11","value":"--","page":2,"x":306,"y":689},{"name":"Eq Name12","value":"Tinderbox","page":2,"x":112,"y":704},{"name":"Eq Qty12","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":704},{"name":"Eq Weight12","value":"1 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":704},{"name":"Eq Name13","value":"Book","page":2,"x":112,"y":718},{"name":"Eq Qty13","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":718},{"name":"Eq Weight13","value":"5 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":718},{"name":"Eq Name14","value":"Lamp","page":2,"x":112,"y":733},{"name":"Eq Qty14","value":"1","page":2,"x":272,"y":733},{"name":"Eq Weight14","value":"1 lb.","page":2,"x":306,"y":733},{"name":"Eq Name15","value":"Ink Pen","page":2,"x":349,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Qty15","value":"1","page":2,"x":509,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Weight15","value":"--","page":2,"x":544,"y":525},{"name":"Eq Name16","value":"Ink","page":2,"x":349,"y":540},{"name":"Eq Qty16","value":"1","page":2,"x":509,"y":540},{"name":"Eq Weight16","value":"--","page":2,"x":544,"y":540},{"name":"CharacterName3","value":"Zlatko Galanodel","page":3,"x":47,"y":60},{"name":"CLASS  LEVEL3","value":"Warlock 20","page":3,"x":271,"y":49},{"name":"PLAYER NAME3","value":"Player","page":3,"x":470,"y":49},{"name":"RACE3","value":"Elf","page":3,"x":271,"y":75},{"name":"BACKGROUND3","value":"Noble","page":3,"x":383,"y":75},{"name":"EXPERIENCE POINTS3","value":"(Milestone)","page":3,"x":480,"y":75},{"name":"FeaturesTraits4","value":"turn, when a spell you cast deals Radiant or Fire damage, you can add +3 to that spell’s damage against one of the spell’s targets. * 8: Ability Score Improvement • PHB-2024 155 * Contact Patron • PHB-2024 155 You always have Contact Other Plane prepared. Once per Long Rest, you can cast the spell without expending a spell slot to contact your patron, and you automatically succeed on the spell’s saving throw. * Celestial Resilience • PHB-2024 161 You gain 23 Temp HP whenever you use your Magical Cunning feature or finish a Short/Long Rest. Additionally, choose up to 5 creatures you can see; those creatures each gain 13 Temp HP. * Mystic Arcanum (Level 6 Spell) • PHB-2024 155 Your patron grants you a magical secret called an arcanum, choose one level 6 Warlock spell as this arcanum. You can cast this spell once per Long Rest before you cast it in this way again. * 12: Ability Score Improvement • PHB-2024 155 * Mystic Arcanum (Level 7 Spell) • PHB-2024 155 Your patron grants you a magical secret called an arcanum, choose one level 7 Warlock spell as this arcanum. You can cast this spell once per Long Rest before you cast it in this way again. * Searing Vengeance • PHB-2024 161 When you or an ally within 60 ft. is about to make a Death Saving Throw, it regains HP equal to half its HP Maximum, and can end the Prone Condition on itself. Each creature of your choice within 30 ft. takes 2d8+3 Radiant damage, and each has the Blinded condition until the end of the current turn.","page":3,"x":36,"y":136},{"name":"FeaturesTraits5","value":"When you use this feature, you can’t use it again until you finish a Long Rest. | 1 / Long Rest • Special * Mystic Arcanum (Level 8 Spell) • PHB-2024 155 Your patron grants you a magical secret called an arcanum, choose one level 8 Warlock spell as this arcanum. You can cast this spell once per Long Rest before you cast it in this way again. * 16: Ability Score Improvement • PHB-2024 155 * Mystic Arcanum (Level 9 Spell) • PHB-2024 155 Your patron grants you a magical secret called an arcanum, choose one level 9 Warlock spell as this arcanum. You can cast this spell once per Long Rest before you cast it in this way again. * Epic Boon • PHB-2024 155 * Eldritch Master • PHB-2024 155 When you use your Magical Cunning feature, you regain all your expended Pact Magic spell slots. === ELF SPECIES TRAITS === * Creature Type • PHB-2024 190 You are a Humanoid. * Size • PHB-2024 190 You are Medium. * Speed • PHB-2024 190 Your speed is 30 ft. * Darkvision • PHB-2024 190 You have Darkvision with a range of 60 ft. * Elven Lineage • PHB-2024 190","page":3,"x":219,"y":136},{"name":"FeaturesTraits6","value":"Choose a lineage from the Elven Lineages table. You gain the level 1 benefit of that lineage. | High Elf Lineage • You gain the spells outlined in the Elven Lineages table, and whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace the cantrip at level 1 with a different cantrip from the Wizard spell list. * Elven Lineage Spells • PHB-2024 189 | High Elf - Charisma • * Fey Ancestry • PHB-2024 190 You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition. * Keen Senses • PHB-2024 190 You have proficiency in the Insight, Perception, or Survival skill. * Trance • PHB-2024 190 You don’t need to sleep, and magic can’t put you to sleep. You can finish a Long Rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a trancelike meditation, during which you retain consciousness. * Languages • PHB-2024 37 Your character knows at least three languages: Common plus two languages you roll or choose from the Standard Languages table. Knowledge of a language means your character can communicate in it, read it, and write it. === FEATS === * Boon of Combat Prowess • PHB-2024 210 Ability Score Increase. One ability score of your choice increased by 1.","page":3,"x":400,"y":136},{"name":"CharacterName3","value":"Zlatko Galanodel","page":4,"x":47,"y":60},{"name":"CLASS  LEVEL3","value":"Warlock 20","page":4,"x":271,"y":49},{"name":"PLAYER NAME3","value":"Player","page":4,"x":470,"y":49},{"name":"RACE3","value":"Elf","page":4,"x":271,"y":75},{"name":"BACKGROUND3","value":"Noble","page":4,"x":383,"y":75},{"name":"EXPERIENCE POINTS3","value":"(Milestone)","page":4,"x":480,"y":75},{"name":"FeaturesTraits4","value":"Peerless Aim. Once per turn, when you miss an attack roll, you can hit instead. * Boon of Fortitude • PHB-2024 210 Ability Score Increase. One ability score of your choice increased by 1. Fortified Health. Your HP maximum increases by 40. In addition, whenever you regain HP, you can regain additional HP equal to your Constitution modifier. Once you've regained these additional HP, you can't do so again until the start of your next turn. * Boon of Truesight • PHB-2024 211 Ability Score Increase.One ability score of your choice increased by 1. Truesight. You have Truesight with a range of 60 feet. * Sentinel • PHB-2024 207 Ability Score Increase. Increase your Str. or Dex. by 1. Guardian. Immediately after a creature within 5 ft. of you takes the Disengage action or hits a target other than you with an attack, you can make an Opportunity Attack against that creature. Halt. When you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attack, the creature’s Speed becomes 0 for the rest of the current turn. * Boon of Irresistible Offense • PHB-2024 211 Ability Score Increase. Str. or Dex. increased by 1. Overcome Defenses. The Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage you deal always ignores Resistance. Overwhelming Strike. When you roll a 20 on the d20 for an attack roll, you can deal extra damage to the target equal to the ability score increased by this feat. The extra damage’s type is the same as the attack’s","page":4,"x":36,"y":136},{"name":"FeaturesTraits5","value":"type. | Dexterity • | Overwhelming Strike: Special * Noble Ability Score Improvements • PHB-2024 182 | Increase two scores (+2 / +1) • * Skilled • PHB-2024 201 You gain proficiency in any combination of three skills or tools of your choice. Repeatable. You can take this feat more than once.","page":4,"x":219,"y":136},{"name":"CharacterName4","value":"Zlatko Galanodel","page":5,"x":49,"y":60},{"name":"SIZE","value":"Medium","page":5,"x":399,"y":44},{"name":"spellCastingAbility0","value":"CHA","page":6,"x":284,"y":56},{"name":"spellSaveDC0","value":"17","page":6,"x":384,"y":56},{"name":"spellAtkBonus0","value":"+9","page":6,"x":488,"y":56},{"name":"spellCastingClass0","value":"Warlock","page":6,"x":48,"y":65},{"name":"spellHeader0","value":"=== CANTRIPS ===","page":6,"x":42,"y":152},{"name":"spellSlotHeader0","value":"(At Will)","page":6,"x":149,"y":152},{"name":"spellPrepared0","value":"O","page":6,"x":29,"y":164},{"name":"spellName0","value":"Prestidigitation","page":6,"x":42,"y":164},{"name":"spellSource0","value":"Warlock","page":6,"x":149,"y":164},{"name":"spellSaveHit0","value":"--","page":6,"x":232,"y":164},{"name":"spellCastingTime0","value":"1A","page":6,"x":258,"y":164},{"name":"spellRange0","value":"10 ft.","page":6,"x":278,"y":164},{"name":"spellComponents0","value":"V,S","page":6,"x":320,"y":164},{"name":"spellDuration0","value":"1 hour","page":6,"x":343,"y":164},{"name":"spellPage0","value":"PHB-2024 307","page":6,"x":389,"y":164},{"name":"spellNotes0","value":"D: 1h, V/S","page":6,"x":423,"y":164},{"name":"spellPrepared1","value":"O","page":6,"x":29,"y":175},{"name":"spellName1","value":"Eldritch Blast","page":6,"x":42,"y":175},{"name":"spellSource1","value":"Warlock","page":6,"x":149,"y":175},{"name":"spellSaveHit